msgid ""
"Package not available in the enabled repositories. It may come from the AUR, "
"belong to a disabled repository (such as multilib), or the package database "
"may be outdated.\n"
"Suggestion: Update the whole system with 'sudo pacman -Syu' and try again."
msgstr ""
"Balík nie je k dispozícii v povolených repozitároch. Môže pochádzať z AUR, "
"patriť do zakázaného repozitára (napríklad multilib) alebo môže byť databáza "
"balíkov zastaraná.  \n"
"Návrh: Aktualizujte celý systém pomocou 'sudo pacman -Syu' a skúste to znova."

# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py,
# line: 319
msgid ""
"A conflict prevented the operation from completing.\n"
"Suggestion: Clean the cache and update with 'sudo pacman -Scc' followed by "
"'sudo pacman -Syyu'."
msgstr ""
"Konflikt zabránil dokončeniu operácie.\n"
"Odporúčanie: Vyčistite cache a aktualizujte príkazmi 'sudo pacman -Scc' a "
"potom 'sudo pacman -Syyu'."

# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py,
# line: 327
msgid ""
"Some files from this package already exist on the system.\n"
"Suggestion: Check which package owns the file with 'pacman -Qo <file_path>' "
"and resolve the conflict."
msgstr ""
"Niektoré súbory z tohto balíka už existujú v systéme.\n"
"Odporúčanie: Skontrolujte, ktorý balík vlastní súbor príkazom 'pacman -Qo "
"<file_path>' a vyriešte konflikt."

# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py,
# line: 335
msgid ""
"Required dependencies could not be resolved.\n"
"Suggestion: Update the full system first with 'sudo pacman -Syu'."
msgstr ""
"Nepodarilo sa vyriešiť požadované závislosti.\n"
"Odporúčanie: Najskôr aktualizujte celý systém príkazom 'sudo pacman -Syu'."

# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py,
# line: 342
msgid ""
"Package signature could not be verified.\n"
"Suggestion: Update your keyrings with 'sudo pacman -S archlinux-keyring "
"manjaro-keyring'."
msgstr ""
"Podpis balíka sa nepodarilo overiť.\n"
"Odporúčanie: Aktualizujte svoje kľúčenky príkazom 'sudo pacman -S archlinux-"
"keyring manjaro-keyring'."

# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py,
# line: 350
msgid ""
"The package database is locked by another process.\n"
"If no other package manager is running, remove the lock with 'sudo rm /var/"
"lib/pacman/db.lck'."
msgstr ""
"Databáza balíkov je zablokovaná iným procesom.\n"
"Ak žiadny iný správca balíkov nebeží, odstráňte zámok príkazom 'sudo rm /var/"
"lib/pacman/db.lck'."

# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py,
# line: 358
msgid ""
"Not enough disk space to complete the operation.\n"
"Suggestion: Free space by clearing the package cache with 'sudo pacman -Scc'."
msgstr ""
"Nedostatok miesta na disku na dokončenie operácie.\n"
"Odporúčanie: Uvoľnite miesto vyčistením cache balíčkov príkazom 'sudo pacman "
"-Scc'."

# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py,
# line: 366
msgid ""
"Could not download required files.\n"
"Suggestion: Check your internet connection. If the problem persists, try "
"updating your mirror list."
msgstr ""
"Nepodarilo sa stiahnuť požadované súbory.\n"
"Odporúčanie: Skontrolujte svoje internetové pripojenie. Ak problém "
"pretrváva, skúste aktualizovať zoznam zrkadiel."

# File: big-driver-manager/usr/share/big-driver-manager/core/base_manager.py,
# line: 374
msgid ""
"A downloaded package is corrupted.\n"
"Suggestion: Clear the cache with 'sudo pacman -Scc' and try again."
msgstr ""
"Stiahnutý balíček je poškodený.\n"
"Odporúčanie: Vyčistite cache príkazom 'sudo pacman -Scc' a skúste to znova."

